From 4687aea85fcf24a5bc0266598f06c9b9120017e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Captain Polliwog build <build@captainpolliwog.invalid>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:33:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] JavaScript: async generators and for await (ES2018)

async function*, async generator methods, for await (x of y) and
Symbol.asyncIterator. An async generator's body is compiled as a
generator's; its awaits and yields both suspend it, and a yield first marks
itself on the generator object. builtins/AsyncGeneratorPrototype.js drives
the body the way @asyncFunctionResume drives an async function's, queues
next/return/throw requests and does yield* delegation. for await gets its
iterator from @getAsyncIterator, which wraps a plain iterable's iterator,
and awaits each result and the return() of an early exit.

SourceParseMode grows to 32 bits for the three new parse modes.
